# Pegboard's own sources (//pegboard in the Chromium tree). //chrome targets
# depend on its parts directly, each through its patch: //pegboard/devtools
# (the Pegboard CDP domain) from //chrome/browser/devtools
# (pegboard-cdp-domain.patch), //pegboard/browser_parts (the browser-wide parts:
# agent profiles' marks, and //pegboard/bootstrap, which starts pegboardd with
# the DevTools pipe) from //chrome/browser (pegboard-bootstrap.patch). They
# share //pegboard/common and //pegboard/ui.
